{
  "name": "LeadFlow - Website Leads to Google Sheets + Discord",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# LeadFlow – Setup\n\n1. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` in all Google Sheets nodes.\n2. Create tabs `Leads` and `Logs` with the headers listed below.\n3. Select your Google Sheets OAuth2 credential in every Sheets node.\n4. Select/create separate Discord webhook credentials for `#priority` and `#leads`.\n5. Test with the Webhook Test URL, then publish the workflow for the Production URL.\n\n**Leads headers**\n`receivedAt, leadId, name, email, phone, company, source, budget, urgency, message`\n\n**Logs headers**\n`timestamp, leadId, email, status, detail, priority`\n\n**GitHub note:** This exported workflow contains no credential IDs, webhook IDs, instance ID, workflow ID, or real Google Sheet ID.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "10f5d57b-575f-4079-8760-a7b5cbc1b1aa",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2256,
        384
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Expected POST body\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Max Mustermann\",\n  \"email\": \"max@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+49 170 1234567\",\n  \"company\": \"Muster GmbH\",\n  \"source\": \"website\",\n  \"budget\": 7500,\n  \"urgency\": \"high\",\n  \"message\": \"We need a proposal and a call this week.\"\n}\n```\n\nRequired: `name`, `email`, `message`.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "f0a47264-62dd-4f18-85be-c78f3025f622",
      "name": "Input Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2256,
        928
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "leadflow",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1c004b45-74c5-4507-96b1-c52261ed1537",
      "name": "Webhook - New Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        2880,
        912
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const input = $input.first().json;\nconst raw = input.body ?? input;\n\nconst clean = (value) => String(value ?? '')\n  .trim()\n  .replace(/\\s+/g, ' ');\n\nconst email = clean(raw.email).toLowerCase();\nconst name = clean(raw.name);\nconst message = clean(raw.message);\nconst company = clean(raw.company);\nconst source = clean(raw.source) || 'website';\nconst urgency = clean(raw.urgency).toLowerCase();\n\nlet phone = clean(raw.phone);\nphone = phone ? phone.replace(/[^\\d+]/g, '') : '';\n\nconst parseBudget = (value) => {\n  if (value === null || value === undefined || value === '') return null;\n  if (typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value)) return value;\n\n  let s = String(value).trim().replace(/[^\\d,.-]/g, '');\n  if (!s) return null;\n\n  if (s.includes(',') && s.includes('.')) {\n    if (s.lastIndexOf(',') > s.lastIndexOf('.')) {\n      s = s.replace(/\\./g, '').replace(',', '.');\n    } else {\n      s = s.replace(/,/g, '');\n    }\n  } else if (s.includes(',')) {\n    s = s.replace(',', '.');\n  }\n\n  const n = Number(s);\n  return Number.isFinite(n) ? n : null;\n};\n\nconst budget = parseBudget(raw.budget);\nconst errors = [];\n\nif (!name) errors.push('name is required');\nif (!email) {\n  errors.push('email is required');\n} else if (!/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email)) {\n  errors.push('email is invalid');\n}\nif (!message) errors.push('message is required');\nif (message.length > 5000) errors.push('message must be <= 5000 characters');\nif (budget !== null && budget < 0) errors.push('budget must be >= 0');\n\nconst receivedAt = new Date().toISOString();\nconst leadId = `lead_${Date.now()}_${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 10)}`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    isValid: errors.length === 0,\n    validationErrors: errors,\n    receivedAt,\n    leadId,\n    name,\n    email,\n    phone,\n    company,\n    source,\n    budget,\n    urgency,\n    message\n  }\n}];"
      },
